      "title": "Part 5 - Incomplete Sentences (No. 259)",
      "difficulty": "750",
      "skill": "Advanced Parallel Structure",
      "passage": "",
      "question": "The updated inventory management software not only accelerates order processing ------- generates real-time predictive analytics for warehouse supervisors.",
