      "difficulty": "750",
      "skill": "Contextual Vocabulary (Verb - Collocation with Policy)",
      "passage": "INTERNAL MEMO: Corporate Expense Reimbursement\n\nAll travel reimbursement claims must be submitted within 14 business days of returning from a business trip. To ------- with corporate accounting policies, itemized receipts must accompany every expense claim exceeding $25.",
