      "difficulty": "750",
      "skill": "Contextual Vocabulary (Verb)",
      "passage": "IT SECURITY DIRECTIVE: Periodic Credential Updates\n\nTo safeguard confidential client data from unauthorized access, all network passwords must be updated every 90 days. Passwords must contain a minimum of twelve characters, including uppercase letters, numbers, and special symbols. Users are strictly forbidden to ------- their credentials with colleagues or write them on physical notes.",
