      "difficulty": "900",
      "skill": "Discourse Connector (Contrast)",
      "passage": "LEASE AGREEMENT: Maintenance Obligations\nParagraph 12.2:\n\nThe Tenant shall maintain the interior decor, flooring, and lighting fixtures in good working order throughout the occupancy term. -------, the Landlord shall retain full responsibility for structural repairs, exterior roof maintenance, and primary utility conduits.",
