      "part": "Part 6 - Text Completion",
      "title": "Part 6 - Text Completion (No. 134)",
      "difficulty": "600",
      "skill": "Indefinite Pronoun Reference",
      "passage": "MEMORANDUM\nTo: Junior Financial Analysts\nFrom: Training and Development Dept.\nDate: August 5\nSubject: Advanced Financial Modeling Workshop\n\nWe are excited to offer an intensive two-day workshop on financial modeling and valuation techniques next month. Because seating in the computer lab is limited to twenty participants, ------- interested in attending should register through the learning management system by Friday.",
