      "difficulty": "750",
      "skill": "Sentence Insertion",
      "passage": "MEMORANDUM\nTo: Production Line Supervisors\nFrom: Mark Sterling, Plant Operations Manager\nDate: May 11\nSubject: Upcoming ISO 14001 External Audit\n\nAn external team of environmental compliance auditors will inspect our manufacturing facilities on May 24 and 25. The auditors will review chemical disposal records, wastewater treatment logs, and energy monitoring documentation. -------. Please ensure that all shift logs are completely up to date and readily accessible in the control room.",
