      "passage": "Dear Ms. Faulkner,\n\nThank you for bringing the billing discrepancy on invoice #INV-7801 to our attention. Following a thorough review by our accounting department, we have verified that the recurring subscription fee was mistakenly charged twice. We have processed a full refund of $149.00 to your credit card and sincerely apologize for any inconvenience this administrative error may have -------.",
