      "difficulty": "750",
      "skill": "Contextual Vocabulary (Noun)",
      "passage": "SUSTAINABILITY HIGHLIGHTS: FY 2026\n\nOver the past twelve months, GreenTech Enterprises has accelerated its transition toward renewable energy. Through the installation of rooftop solar photovoltaic arrays across our primary manufacturing hubs, we achieved a significant ------- in grid electricity consumption, exceeding our annual emissions reduction target.",
