      "passage": "EXECUTIVE FLEET TRANSITION MEMORANDUM\n\nTo: Corporate Logistics & Facilities Committee\nFrom: Chief Sustainability Officer\nDate: May 19\nSubject: Fleet Electrification Phase II Deployment\n\nIn our ongoing effort to reduce corporate carbon emissions by 40% by 2028, the company has finalized the acquisition of 75 fully electric commercial vans. These vehicles ------- to regional fulfillment hubs next Tuesday following the completion of onboard telemetry installation. Fleet managers should ensure charging infrastructure at all depots is operational prior to delivery.",
