      "passage": "Customer Support Case Ticket #CS-99412\nMerchant: Lumina Audio Technologies\nCustomer: Derek Lindqvist | Order #LA-883011\nProduct: Lumina StudioPro Wireless Noise-Canceling Headphones ($349.00)\n\nCustomer Inquiry (Oct 22, 14:10):\n\"I received my headphones on October 18. While the sound fidelity is outstanding, the left ear cup has an intermittent crackling sound whenever the active noise cancellation feature is turned on. I followed all troubleshooting steps in the online manual (firmware reset and Bluetooth re-pairing), but the issue persists. Since this arrived defective, I request an immediate replacement unit rather than a refund.\"\n\nSupport Representative Response (Oct 23, 09:25):\n\"Dear Mr. Lindqvist,\nThank you for reaching out. We apologize for the hardware fault with your StudioPro headphones. Since your purchase falls well within our 30-day Quality Guarantee, we have initiated an express replacement order (Order #LA-883900-R).\n\nAttached is a prepaid DHL return shipping label. Please place the defective headphones in their original packaging, attach the label, and drop the parcel at any authorized DHL service point within 14 days. As soon as the courier scans the return parcel into their tracking system, your new replacement unit will be dispatched via Next-Day Air at no charge.\"",
