      "passage": "REQUEST FOR PROPOSALS (RFP) EXECUTIVE SUMMARY\nRFP No: RFP-IT-2026-09\nIssuing Organization: Horizon Health Care Alliance\nProject Title: Enterprise Multi-Cloud Migration & HIPAA Compliance Modernization\nSubmission Deadline: November 30, 2026, 5:00 PM EST\n\n1. Project Scope:\nHorizon Health Care Alliance, a regional healthcare network operating 14 acute-care hospitals and 60 outpatient clinics across Ohio and Pennsylvania, invites competitive proposals from certified cloud service integrators. The objective is to migrate our legacy on-premises electronic health record (EHR) databases and medical imaging archives (PACS) to a hybrid multi-cloud infrastructure.\n\n2. Mandatory Vendor Qualifications:\n• Demonstrated experience with minimum 3 enterprise-scale healthcare migrations exceeding 50,000 concurrent users.\n• HITRUST CSF certification and ISO/IEC 27001 compliance.\n• Guaranteed uptime Service Level Agreement (SLA) of 99.99% with zero data loss Recovery Point Objective (RPO <= 0 seconds).\n• 24/7/365 dedicated domestic Security Operations Center (SOC) support.\n\n3. Proposal Submission Instructions:\nTechnical and commercial proposals must be submitted electronically as encrypted PDF documents via our vendor portal at procurement.horizonhealth.org. Late submissions will not be reviewed. Shortlisted vendors will be invited for technical presentations during the week of December 14.",
