      "passage": "LEASE AGREEMENT ADDENDUM: COMMERCIAL STORAGE SPACE\nLandlord: Eastport Logistics Park LP\nTenant: Nordic Cold Chain Logistics Inc.\nPremises: Building 7, Bays C through F (Total: 45,000 sq. ft.)\nEffective Date: November 1\n\nThis Addendum modifies the Master Commercial Lease Agreement dated January 15, 2025, between Landlord and Tenant.\n\nSection 4.2: Pallet Staging and Temperature Compliance\nTenant shall maintain the automated temperature logging system within Bays C and D at or below -18°C for deep-freeze seafood inventory. Landlord reserves the right to conduct unannounced quarterly inspections of refrigeration condenser coils.\n\nSection 8.1: Expansion Option & Reserve Capacity\nIn consideration of Tenant's expanded regional distribution contract, Landlord hereby grants Tenant an exclusive right of first refusal for the adjacent 15,000-square-foot Bay G. Should Landlord receive a bona fide third-party offer to lease Bay G, Tenant shall have ten (10) business days following written notification to execute an amendment incorporating Bay G at the prevailing market rate. Failure to exercise this option within the designated window shall extinguish Tenant's priority claim, permitting Landlord to lease the premises to external parties without further encumbrance.\n\nSection 12.4: Subletting Restrictions\nTenant shall not assign or sublet any portion of the cold-storage infrastructure without Landlord's prior written consent, which shall not be unreasonably withheld or delayed.",
