      "skill": "Vocabulary in Context",
      "passage": "SETTLEMENT AND MUTUAL RELEASE OF CLAIMS AGREEMENT\nParties: Pinnacle Retail Holdings Inc. ('Claimant') and Kestrel Logistics LLC ('Respondent')\nArbitration Case Ref: AAA-COM-2026-9014\nDate of Execution: October 28\n\nRecitals:\nWhereas disputes arose between Claimant and Respondent regarding demurrage assessments, container detention charges, and delayed ocean container transfers at the Port of Long Beach between March and July 2026;\n\nNow, Therefore, in consideration of the mutual promises herein contained, the Parties agree as follows:\n\n1. Settlement Consideration:\nRespondent shall wire the non-negotiable sum of $325,000 to Claimant's designated escrow trust account within fifteen (15) calendar days of the full execution of this Agreement.\n\n2. Release of Claims:\nUpon timely receipt and clearance of the Settlement Consideration, Claimant hereby fully discharges and releases Respondent from any and all past, present, or contingent liabilities, liens, and causes of action arising directly or indirectly from the disputed maritime shipments.\n\n3. Confidentiality:\nThe Parties agree that the terms and monetary considerations of this Agreement shall remain confidential and shall not be disclosed to any third party without prior written consent, except as required by statutory judicial decree or mandatory financial audit disclosure.",
