      "passage": "OCCUPATIONAL SAFETY & HEALTH ADMINISTRATION (OSHA)\nNOTICE OF CITATION AND NOTIFICATION OF PENALTY\nInspection Number: 1489201\nIssuance Date: August 19\nTo: Apex Structural Scaffolding Corp.\nSite Address: 440 West Elm Street Commercial High-Rise Project\n\nCitation 1, Item 1 — 29 CFR 1926.451(g)(1):\nThe employer failed to ensure that each employee on a supported scaffold more than 10 feet above a lower level was protected from falling to that lower level by the installation of adequate guardrail systems or personal fall arrest systems.\n\nInspection Observation:\nOn August 3, OSHA compliance safety officers observed four structural ironworkers erecting modular tube-and-coupler scaffolding at the 14th-floor perimeter without full-body harness lanyards anchored to certified tie-off points, exposing personnel to a 140-foot fall hazard.\n\nMandated Abatement Actions:\n1. Immediate cessation of all scaffolding assembly until complete guardrail systems and independent safety lifelines are secured.\n2. Submission of verified training logs confirming that all on-site personnel have completed the 8-hour Advanced Fall Hazard Awareness Course.\n3. Penalty Assessment: A fine of $16,131 is hereby assessed for this Serious Violation.\n\nAbatement Date: September 2. The employer must file a Certificate of Abatement prior to this date or file a formal Notice of Contest within 15 business days.",
